+---
+id: task-004-hourly-rentals
+type: task
+title: "Hourly rentals"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Let customers rent by the hour. `addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice` (what one hour costs). A rental
+shorter than a day that starts and ends on the hour is priced at the item's hourly price for each hour. An item
+without an hourly price cannot be rented by the hour.
+
+## Done
+
+- `Equipment.hourlyPrice` (optional, non-negative integer cents, validated) in `src/index.ts`.
+- `price`: whole-day (midnight to midnight) periods are unchanged; any other period must start and end on the hour
+  (UTC) and be shorter than 24 h, and is priced hours x `hourlyPrice` with no long-rental discount. It throws for
+  an item without `hourlyPrice`, and for a non-midnight period of a day or more.
+- `availability` accepts hourly periods too (then only items with an hourly price are candidates).
+- Tests in `test/rental.test.ts`; `npm test` passes.
